  "contract": [
    "Raise: Greater Skeletal Warrior (504901) promises that Command: Skeletal Warriors (570042) applies Pierced",
    "(570216, -10% armor per stack for 15 sec, StackAmount 2). Live Ascension combat logs",
    "(2026-08-30-18.19.46 WoWCombatLog.txt:8251-8284) show multiple Greater Skeletal Warriors stacking Pierced onto",
    "one shared 2-stack debuff on a single Command. Without SPELL_ATTR0_CU_SINGLE_AURA_STACK on 570216, each",
    "warrior's cast misses the other warrior's aura in Unit::_TryStackingOrRefreshingExistingAura and",
    "Aura::CanStackWith removes the previous warrior's aura, pinning Pierced at 1 stack. Expected: with two",
    "Greater Skeletal Warriors raised, one Command: Undead (504868) stacks Pierced to 2 and reduces the target's",
    "armor by 20% (0.80x), and a subsequent Command stays capped at 2 stacks."
